 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can't complain.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it actually dangerous to leave cooked rice out overnight? My flatmate does it all the time.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "block": "cooking.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It can be. Rice can carry bacteria spores that survive cooking and multiply at room temperature.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cooking.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I ask about something else? Storm's due tomorrow evening and my gutters are full of leaves.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx11",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That could mean overflow. Will you climb up and clear them yourself today, or call someone in?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I haven't decided. Give me twenty-three seconds, then ask me again.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "think_time",
   "wait_sec": 23,
   "phrasing": "think_instr_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hmm, either way, really.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 6,
    "offset": 6.88
   },
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "self_talk",
   "phrasing": "self_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "So, ladder yourself, or call someone?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx11",
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 6,
    "offset": 23.49
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'll do it. It's a bungalow, it's not that high.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Fine, but have someone hold the ladder and use gloves, there can be sharp bits in there.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "followup",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "But he's never been sick.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cooking.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Lots of people get lucky. It's still better to cool rice within an hour and put it in the fridge.",
